{"title": "Scroll Table", "pageid": 14550, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scroll_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Scroll Table</b>, also known as <code>Scroll</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Scroll+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Scroll+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains all <a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\">Scrolls</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Scroll Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Single_Scroll_Supply_Table\" title=\"Single Scroll Supply Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll.png/40px-Scroll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll.png/60px-Scroll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/8d/Scroll.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll.png/40px-Scroll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Scroll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Single_Scroll_Supply_Table\" title=\"Single Scroll Supply Table\">Single Scroll Supply Table</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">3/4</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Single_Utility_Scroll_Supply_Table\" title=\"Single Utility Scroll Supply Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png/40px-Scroll_Utility.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png/60px-Scroll_Utility.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png/40px-Scroll_Utility.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Scroll_Utility.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Single_Utility_Scroll_Supply_Table\" title=\"Single Utility Scroll Supply Table\">Single Utility Scroll Supply Table</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/4</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714225114\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 952/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9006/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1997/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 826189/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion